<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus accepts Glencore barley offer.</title>
<headline>Cyprus accepts Glencore barley offer.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission said on Tuesday it accepted the tender of Glencore Grain Rotterdam BV for 25,000 tonnes of barley at $138.45 per tonne CIF, the commission said in a statement.</p>
<p>It did not specify shipment dates.</p>
</text>
